id: tune-up
name: Tune Up
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Craft (Vehicles)
# Craft (Vehicles), a Skill of its own.
requiresSkill: craftVehicles
requiresRanks: 2
sessionLimit: 1
timeCost: 4 Hours
# Vehicles and Battle Jackets are not in this system: what it does is said on the card, and done by
# the table.
effectNote: recreates a Vehicle or Battle Jacket exactly as it was (with their current Power Level and - for a Battle Jacket - their Scholarship Score if higher than its Jacket Attribute)
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Four hours on a Vehicle or Battle Jacket: made again as it was, at your current Power Level - and a
  Battle Jacket at your Scholarship Score, if that is higher.
text: >
  Tune Up: You repair and upgrade a vehicle, routinely maintaining its form and function.
  –Prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Craft (Vehicles)
  –Session Limit: 1
  –Time Cost: 4 Hours
  –Effect: Recreate a Vehicle or Battle Jacket exactly as it was, but with your current Power Level
  and (for Battle Jackets) your Scholarship Score (if its higher than the current Jacket Attribute).

---

# Offered on the Adventure tab to whoever has 2+ Ranks in Craft (Vehicles).
# The use counts, the card says the Time Cost, and its button - once the time is spent - says what it
# does. Vehicles and Battle Jackets are not built: the recreating is the table's.
